<title>GERMANY: Duerr profit up after first nine months 199.</title>
<headline>Duerr profit up after first nine months 199.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end September 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group new orders			   1,480   vs 1,341</p>
<p>    Group orders				 1,836   vs 1,617</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   19.5    vs 18.1</p>
<p>    Group sales				  863     vs 712</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German plant manufacturing group is Duerr AG. New orders were boosted by an order from Audi AG worth 400 million marks, the company said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
